+// ---- R4 (independent review R3 c.6795489308): B3-1 separator/case variants, B3-2 stray letters ----
+test('R4 B3-1/B3-2: every suffix spelling is a suffix (never truncated to I); stray letters and lone L/C are gaps', async () => {
